```{=html}
<div class="work-grid list">
<% for (const item of items) { %>
<a class="wcard" href="<%- item.path %>" <%= metadataAttrs(item) %>>
<div class="pimg">
<% if (item.image) { %><img src="<%- item.image %>" alt="" loading="lazy"><% } else { %><div class="noimg"><%= item.title.charAt(0) %></div><% } %>
<span class="cat"><%= item.cat_label %></span>
</div>
<div class="pbody">
<div class="meta"><%= item.course %></div>
<h3><%= item.title %></h3>
<p><%= item.description %></p>
<% if (item.stat) { %><div class="find"><b><%= item.stat %></b> <%= item.stat_text %></div><% } %>
<span class="go">Case study →</span>
</div>
</a>
<% } %>
</div>
```
